","start":319,"end":319,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":323,"end":323,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Domain","start":446,"end":505,"description":"SH3"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":455,"end":455,"description":"Phosphotyrosine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":466,"end":466,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":507,"end":507,"description":"Phosphothreonine"}],"interfaces":{},"subunit":[{"topic":"Subunit","text":"Interacts with ABL1, ENAH, STX1A, SNAP25, VAMP2, EPS8, and through its N-terminus with WASF1. Part of a complex consisting of ABI1, STX1A and SNAP25. Part of a complex consisting of ABI1, EPS8 and SOS1 (By similarity). Interacts with SOS1, SOS2, GRB2, SPTA1 and the first SH3 domain of NCK1. Isoform 6 does not interact with NCK1. Component of the WAVE2 complex composed of ABI1, CYFIP1/SRA1, NCKAP1/NAP1 (NCKAP1l/HEM1 in hematopoietic cells) and WASF2/WAVE2 (PubMed:16417406). Interacts (via SH3 domain) with SHANK2 and SHANK3, but not SHANK1; the interaction is direct. Interacts with the heterodimer MYC:MAX; the interaction may enhance MYC:MAX transcriptional activity. Interacts with FNBP1L (via the SH3 domain), WASF2, and CDC42, but only in the presence of FNBP1L (PubMed:19798448)"},{"topic":"Subunit","text":"(Microbial infection) Interacts with human cytomegalovirus/HHV-5 protein UL135"}],"isoforms":[{"accession":"Q8IZP0-2","name":"2","synonyms":["long","B48"],"notes":[],"length":446,"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000376166.5"],"refseq":["NM_001178121.2"],"refseqProteins":["NP_001171592.1"],"maneSelect":false,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"segments":[[1,1,153],[154,159,115],[269,302,58],[327,389,120]],"edits":[{"start":154,"end":158,"original":"KWLKA","replacement":"","added":0},{"start":274,"end":301,"original":"ENISVPPPSGAPPAPPLAPLLPVSTVIA","replacement":"","added":0},{"start":360,"end":388,"original":"ISIAPPPPPMPQLTPQIPLTGFVARVQEN","replacement":"","added":0}],"missing":62,"rep